{"language":"kr","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","一箭封喉"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/kr","일격필살"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对所有敌人造成伤害，对“衰老”的敌人造成伤害提高并使其眩晕。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/kr","모든 적에게 대미지를 입히며, 쇠약 상태의 적에게 입히는 대미지가 증가하며 스턴시킨다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","波妮射出魔法箭，对每个敌人造成2次180% + 20% ATK伤害。魔法箭对“衰老”的敌人造成伤害提升30%，并使其眩晕，持续3 + 0.25秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","보니가 마법 화살을 발사해 각각의 적에게 180% + 20% ATK의 대미지를 2회 입힌다. 마법 화살이 쇠약 상태의 적에게 입히는 대미지가 30% 증가하고 3 + 0.25초간 스턴시킨다."],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":21,"end":27,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":64,"end":71,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":27,"end":33,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":89,"end":96,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":17,"end":31,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":23,"end":37,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至190% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 190% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至200% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 200% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至210% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 210% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至220% + 20% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 220% + 20% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","黯影衰朽"],["/skills/1/name_i18n/kr","어둠의 부패"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","使得最靠后的敌人获得“衰老”，降低急速，“衰老”的敌人受到其他魔法伤害时会增强“衰老”的效果。"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/kr","가장 뒤에 위치한 적에게 쇠약을 부여하고 급속을 감소시킨다. 쇠약 상태의 적이 기타 마법 대미지를 받을 경우 쇠약 효과가 강화된다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，波妮对最靠后的敌人施加“衰老”魔法，对其造成150% + 10% ATK伤害并使其降低30点急速，持续到战斗结束，波妮会优先攻击这名敌人。\n每有其他友方英雄对“衰老”的敌人造成魔法伤害，会使其携带的“衰老”魔法进一步增强，额外降低10点急速。同一名友军至多使“衰老”魔法增强1次。通过这个方式，“衰老”魔法至多增强2次，且在增至最强后，使该敌人降低30% + 3%攻击力，并且每1秒受到100% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","전투 시작 시, 보니는 가장 뒤에 위치한 적에게 “쇠약” 마법을 부여하여 150% + 10% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 전투가 끝날 때까지 급속을 30 감소시킨다. 보니는 해당 적을 우선적으로 공격한다. \n기타 아군 영웅이 “쇠약” 상태의 적에게 마법 대미지를 입힐 때마다 “쇠약” 마법이 한층 더 강화되어 추가로 급속을 10 감소시킨다. 같은 아군은 “쇠약” 마법을 최대 1회 강화할 수 있으며, “쇠약” 마법은 해당 방식으로 최대 2회까지 강화된다. 또한, “쇠약” 마법이 최대치까지 강화되면 해당 적의 공격력이 30% + 3% 감소하고, 해당 적은 1초마다 100% ATK의 대미지를 받는다."],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":38,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":183,"end":188,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":45,"end":51,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"},{"start":292,"end":297,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":28,"end":42,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":199,"end":207,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":41,"end":55,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":315,"end":323,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至160% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 160% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至170% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 170% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","伤害提高至180% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/kr","대미지가 180% + 10% ATK로 증가한다."],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":9,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":5,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","流雾飞羽"],["/skills/2/name_i18n/kr","안개 속 날개"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","化为黑雾移动至安全位置。"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/kr","미아즈마로 변해 안전한 위치로 이동한다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","化为黑雾移动至4格内安全位置，并发射共6枚飞箭，每一枚对敌人造成35% + 5% ATK伤害，黑雾期间自身处于无敌状态。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/kr","미아즈마로 변신해 4칸 내의 안전한 위치로 이동하고 총 6개의 화살을 발사한다. 각 화살은 적에게 35% + 5% ATK의 대미지를 입히고, 미아즈마 상태 기간에 자신은 무적 상태가 된다."],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":35,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":58,"end":63,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":32,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":55,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/kr",[{"start":55,"end":67,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},